# Retrofit Project Rules & Guidelines

## 1. Architectural Integrity
- The project follows a modular structure. Do not introduce cross-layer or sideways imports in new or refactored code.
- Always check existing module boundaries before adding new dependencies.

## 2. Change Scope & Safety
- Keep PRs/changes small and targeted.
- Before finishing any task, ensure existing tests pass and types are valid.

## 3. Session Continuity
- At the end of a session or a major bug fix, document key decisions, quirks, or edge cases in `docs/LESSONS.md`.